      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.43,
      "end_seconds": 10.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Yes come in and and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 11.53,
      "end_seconds": 15.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.74,
      "end_seconds": 21.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "That's fine sit down. We'll go through it together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.52,
      "end_seconds": 24.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "It's heavy periods, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.27,
      "end_seconds": 30.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "Can you list what you take tablets creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 31.57,
      "end_seconds": 35.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "well it's hydrocortisone cream when needed doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.72,
      "end_seconds": 41.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Is that that long-standing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 42.33,
      "end_seconds": 43.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "about six months"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.28,
      "end_seconds": 46.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.24,
      "end_seconds": 60.97,
      "duration_seconds": 12.73,
      "text": "it's been nearly five years, I'm fairly sure i was feeling exhausted at one point, you know, but that's gone now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.58,
      "end_seconds": 64.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Any pelvic pain, chest pain or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.42,
      "end_seconds": 71.31,
      "duration_seconds": 5.89,
      "text": "I haven't had pelvic pain, chest pain or fainting, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.54,
      "end_seconds": 76.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.16,
      "end_seconds": 80.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "nothing on the skin, um, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.67,
      "end_seconds": 85.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Right any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.57,
      "end_seconds": 90.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.87,
      "end_seconds": 96.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.08,
      "end_seconds": 116.02,
      "duration_seconds": 17.94,
      "text": "I've had eczema for nearly five years now i told myself I'd wait and and see, and here I am a neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.92,
      "end_seconds": 119.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "yes. Tell me about your eating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.32,
      "end_seconds": 126.52,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.74,
      "end_seconds": 129.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "right, and your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.97,
      "end_seconds": 134.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.32,
      "end_seconds": 136.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.6,
      "end_seconds": 141.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.01,
      "end_seconds": 155.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.16,
      "end_seconds": 158.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "no allergies at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.88,
      "end_seconds": 160.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.82,
      "end_seconds": 175.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.87,
      "end_seconds": 198.99,
      "duration_seconds": 9.12,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.4 degrees, SpO2 97 percent on room air, BP is 125 over 68, respiratory rate 18, pulse 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.88,
      "end_seconds": 206.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "alright over here please and I'll take a look"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.05,
      "end_seconds": 214.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.59,
      "end_seconds": 216.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.85,
      "end_seconds": 236.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "your eyelids and the palms of your hands look pale"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.04,
      "end_seconds": 241.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.21,
      "end_seconds": 278.04,
      "duration_seconds": 22.83,
      "text": "A pelvic ultrasound is what I'd like next, for heavy periods. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. I'm going to put you on tranexamic acid, 1 gram, three times a day during periods, for four days each cycle. It's for heavy periods"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.01,
      "end_seconds": 281.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "mm, alright"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.86,
      "end_seconds": 297.22,
      "duration_seconds": 14.36,
      "text": "Iron can darken the stools and bother the stomach so take it after food. I'll also refer you to the gynaecology clinic. Please come and see me in six weeks. Okay that's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.02,
      "end_seconds": 302.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Um, no, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    }
  ]
